# Security headers for all responses (Cloudflare Pages honours this file).
#
# NOTE: a full Content-Security-Policy (script-src / connect-src / frame-src /
# worker-src) still needs to be added and validated against the app's real
# origins — self, Cloudflare Turnstile (challenges.cloudflare.com), Razorpay
# (checkout.razorpay.com), the R2 upload/download endpoints
# (*.r2.cloudflarestorage.com), the CDN, Google Analytics, WASM
# ('wasm-unsafe-eval' for libsodium) and blob: workers. Shipping a strict CSP
# blind would break uploads/payments, so only frame-ancestors is enforced here.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
